WEBVTT

00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:06.900
One prompt asks Pi to implement repository-scoped read authorization.

00:00:07.050 --> 00:00:12.000
Pi runs decapod docs ingest and reads the repository’s instructions.

00:00:32.900 --> 00:00:43.200
Pi claims the task and obtains a governed worktree.

00:02:02.000 --> 00:02:21.000
Decapod runs the required checks on the first candidate.

00:02:29.950 --> 00:02:35.900
The required check fails: missing repository grant.

00:02:38.000 --> 00:02:47.000
Pi investigates the authorization check and implementation.

00:03:21.900 --> 00:03:36.000
Pi changes src/access.cjs to require the repository grant.

00:04:37.000 --> 00:04:45.000
Fresh validation binds its receipt to the repaired commit and accepted base.

00:04:53.000 --> 00:05:02.000
Pi calls Decapod’s workspace publisher for the validated changes.

00:05:40.600 --> 00:05:51.800
GitHub PR #6 matches the validated head and accepted base. Admission grants no merge authorization.
